Domains
0.Parking Floor
1.Parking Lot
2.Parking Spot
3.Vehicle
4.Ticket
5.Payment
6.Entry Gate/Exit Gate

methods
1.assignSpot()
2.generateTicket()
3.parkVehicle()
4.calculateDuration()
5.processPayment()
6.unParkVehicle()

Data flow:
Entry:
vehicle -> entryGate -> assignSpot() + mark spot -> generateTicket() -> parkVehicle()

Exit:
vehicle -> exitGate -> ticketValidation() -> calculateDuration() -> processPayment() -> unparkVehicle() --> unassignSpot()

LayerBreakDown
