Request Handling -> Controllers & DTOs
Business Logic -> Service layer
DB Operations -> Repo layer
utilities -> utility classes

Concerns
1.Concurrency -> synchronization
2.Extensibility -> enums, design patterns
3.Logging -> will place logs every place.
4.Persistence -> DB tables( Vehicle, payment, spot, ticket)
5.Caching -> Cache Available spots in storage.

Design patterns
1.Factory -> vehicle creation
2.Strategy -> payment method
3.Singleton -> parking lot( resource optimisation for shared configs.)
4.Observer -> for notifications
5.State -> payment status

